<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116443" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠτάριον</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖς,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a little ear,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				43
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠτάρι᾽ ὕεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					110.16
				</span></i>
			; later simply 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.75
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>); <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Jo.</u>
				18.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>handle</i> of a vessel, <i><span class="en">
				Parth.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.783c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠτάρια κάδου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.3498.18
				</span></i>
			 (Oropus, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				781i15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				421.54
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> the <i>ormer</i> or <i>Haliotis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.87f
			</span></i>.</div>
